          "text": "Ngakho-ke njengalokhu ngesiphambeko esisodwa ukwahlulelwa kwehlela phezu kwabantu bonke, kube ngukulahlwa; ngokunjalo ngokulunga okukodwa isipho sesihle seza phezu kwabantu bonke kube yikulungisiswa kwempilo.",
          "type": "text",
